  Here is a detailed inventory of the Apache Libcloud APIs as used in libcloud_demo for Nutanix Prism Central (v4 REST).

  ────────────────────────────────────────

  Architecture overview

  libcloud_demo is a Docker-based CLI demo (modeled after libcloud_aws) that talks to Nutanix through a third-party compute 
  driver registered at runtime:

   libcloud_demo/lib/driver.py lines 15-33

  set_driver(
      Provider.NUTANIX_PRISM,
      "nutanix_libcloud_driver.drivers.nutanix_prism",
      "NutanixPrismNodeDriver",
  )
  def get_nutanix_driver():
      """Return a configured Nutanix Prism Libcloud compute driver."""
      cls = get_driver(Provider.NUTANIX_PRISM)
      return cls(
          require_env("NUTANIX_USER"),
          require_env("NUTANIX_PASSWORD"),
          host=nutanix_host(),
          port=nutanix_port(),
          secure=True,
          api_version=nutanix_api_version(),
          verify_ssl_cert=nutanix_verify_ssl(),
      )

  ┌──────────────┬────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │ Component    │ Role                                                                           │
  ├──────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ Driver class │ NutanixPrismNodeDriver (nutanix_libcloud_driver)                               │
  ├──────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ Provider     │ Provider.NUTANIX_PRISM ("nutanix_prism")                                       │
  ├──────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ Backend      │ Nutanix Prism Central v4 REST (vmm, networking, clustermgmt, prism namespaces) │
  ├──────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ Auth         │ Basic auth via .env: NUTANIX_USER, NUTANIX_PASSWORD                            │
  ├──────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ Connection   │ NUTANIX_HOST, NUTANIX_PORT (default 9440), NUTANIX_API_VERSION (default v4.0)  │
  └──────────────┴────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

  Only the compute Libcloud driver is used. There is no separate Libcloud storage, DNS, or load-balancer driver in
  libcloud_demo (those exist in the extended libcloud_demo2 project).

