  4. Async task model

  Most mutating operations (create/update/delete VM, VPC, subnet) are async in Nutanix v4:

  1. HTTP mutation returns a task extId
  2. Driver polls GET /api/prism/{version}/config/tasks/{task_id} until SUCCEEDED / FAILED
  3. Entity extId is extracted from entitiesAffected when available

  Common kwargs on mutations:

  • ex_wait=True (default) — block until task completes
  • ex_wait_timeout=600 — poll timeout in seconds

  VM delete/update additionally require ETag (If-Match) from a preliminary GET.

