  6. Typical end-to-end flow (test_all.sh)

  The integration test exercises this sequence:

  1. List VPCs, subnets, VMs, storage containers
  2. Provision external VLAN subnet → VPC (with external subnet) → overlay subnet → resolve storage → VM
  3. List filtered by created IDs
  4. Edit VPC description, subnet description, VM stop/start/update, storage inspect
