  Async task model

  Same as libcloud_demo:

  • Mutations return a prism task extId
  • Driver polls until SUCCEEDED / FAILED (default ex_wait=True, timeout 600s)
  • VM/volume/image/snapshot DELETE and PUT require ETag (If-Match)

  Volume attach/detach in demo scripts use ex_wait=False for faster test runs.

