  test_all.sh end-to-end flow

  1. List all 14 read-only resources (cluster, size, image, template, subnet, vpc, vm, storage, volume, SG, LB, project, dns,
     object_store)
  2. Provision chain: external VLAN subnet → VPC → overlay subnet → storage resolve → volume → snapshot → clone volume →
     security policy → floating IP → VM
  3. Filtered lists for created resources
  4. Edit: VPC, subnet, VM power/update, volume attach/detach, storage inspect
  5. Destroy: VM → cloned volume → snapshot → volume → floating IP → SG → overlay subnet → VPC → external subnet

